ro:v3"],"evidence_locator":"Official V3 release notice.","support_direction":"supports","note":null,"review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:azuro:event:current-snapshot","field_path":"events[event:azuro:current-snapshot]","assertion":"Current APIs reported $1.56 million of liquidity and a $147,317 positive 30-day pool result, with negative seven- and one-day windows.","value":"2026-08-03","as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:azuro:llama-tvl","source:azuro:llama-fees"],"evidence_locator":"DefiLlama APIs retrieved on the review date.","support_direction":"supports","note":null,"review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}}],"freshness":{"state":"current","last_reviewed_at":"2026-08-03T19:31:32Z","next_review_at":"2026-08-10T19:31:32Z","field_reviews":[]},"quality":{"publication_state":"review","completeness_pct":100,"confidence":"medium","unsourced_fields":["active_bettors","retained_bettors","application_concentration","wagers_by_chain","lp_net_returns","pazur_realized_distributions","app_licences"]},"extensions":{"legacy_origin":"casino_syntheses.outlook","identity_boundary":"Azuro is infrastructure, not a consumer sportsbook. Applications, data providers and AzuroDAO are separate actors, and app activity or legal status is not automatically Azuro’s.","metric_boundary":"Tracked pool liquidity is not users, not application revenue, not executable depth for every market, and not operator solvency. Pool profit/loss is not audited Azuro Ltd. income.","explicit_unknowns":["active and retained bettors by application","application concentration","wagers and fees by chain","risk-adjusted LP returns","actual pAZUR distributions","operator and licence for each frontend"],"methodology_notes":["Application metrics and legal claims are not rolled up into Azuro without app-level evidence.","Negative daily pool results are retained and not hidden by positive cumulative totals."]}}');

INSERT INTO _casino_wave_a_profiles_0087 (case_id, canonical_profile) VALUES ('purebet-solana-exchange', '{"schema":"chaindump-entity-profile","version":1,"identity":{"id":"web3_casino:purebet-solana-exchange","type":"web3_casino","slug":"purebet-solana-exchange","name":"Purebet","aliases":["Purebet.io"]},"classification":{"subtype":"sports betting exchange and liquidity aggregator","tags":["sports_betting","order_book","liquidity_aggregator","noncustodial"],"chains":["Solana"],"jurisdictions":[]},"status":{"operating_state":"hibernating","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:purebet-solana-exchange:status"]},"outcome":{"label":"failed_paused","as_of":"2026-08-03","rule_id":"casino-lifecycle-evidence-v1","confidence":"high","claim_ids":["claim:purebet-solana-exchange:outcome"]},"analysis":{"sections":{"what_it_is":{"body":"Purebet was a noncustodial sports betting exchange and liquidity aggregator built around Solana wallets and USDC. Its own orderbook could match users, while its routing layer searched integrated onchain betting protocols for better odds and placed a corresponding bet when external liquidity won. Users confirmed transactions from their wallets and winnings were designed to return automatically after settlement. This profile covers that official product and frontend, not every protocol it once integrated and not the Solana network itself.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:what_it_is:1","claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:what_it_is:2"]},"what_happened":{"body":"Purebet publicly described an operating exchange in December 2022 and ran a 2023 promotion aimed at users of BetDEX, Aver, Azuro, Overtime and SX Bet. That shows the product reached at least a functioning first phase and competed for existing onchain bettors. The current official homepage now says “Purebet is hibernating” and redirects attention to its community. Legacy documentation remains reachable, but no current tables, markets, releases or activity series were found. The frontend therefore failed to sustain normal operation even though a permanent shutdown has not been announced.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:what_happened:1","claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:what_happened:2"]},"why_this_outcome":{"body":"The cause is unknown. The reviewed sources do not show whether hibernation resulted from thin liquidity, weak demand, regulation, team capacity, competition, funding or a technical problem. The design had clear strengths: no conventional custody, one Solana wallet and aggregation across venues. It also had difficult coordination requirements. Purebet needed enough own-market makers, reliable external integrations, Solana wallet users and bettors willing to adopt an unfamiliar workflow. A 2024 founder discussion described marketing and conversion difficulty, but that self-report is not sufficient to select one causal driver for the product’s later status.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:why_this_outcome:1","claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:why_this_outcome:2"]},"strategic_choices":{"body":"Purebet chose an exchange and aggregation model instead of acting as the house, avoiding direct exposure to every user bet while making liquidity and integration uptime core dependencies. It chose Solana as the user settlement layer so bettors could use one wallet and USDC even when external liquidity came from other chains. It targeted users already active on rival onchain betting protocols, a focused acquisition strategy that reduced education cost but limited the addressable audience. It did not launch a native token in the reviewed period, keeping wagering in USDC and avoiding a separate incentive economy.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:strategic_choices:1","claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:strategic_choices:2"]},"operating_model":{"body":"A user connected a funded Solana wallet, selected an event and saw odds and available liquidity. Purebet’s orderbook could match another user, or the router could place a corresponding bet at an integrated protocol offering better odds. USDC supplied the stake and SOL paid network fees. If routing failed, the order could remain unmatched; after settlement, winnings were designed to return to the user wallet without a manual claim. The frontend, matching engine, integration services and liquidity-aggregation wallet still depended on the Purebet team even though users did not keep a conventional platform balance.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:operating_model:1","claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:operating_model:2"]},"token_and_value_capture":{"body":"No Purebet-native token was identified in the reviewed official and independent directory material. Users wagered in USDC and paid Solana transaction fees in SOL. Avoiding a token removed emissions, unlock and token-liquidity risk from the customer workflow, but it also removed a common crypto incentive and treasury mechanism. The record does not disclose exchange commissions, routing spreads, subscription revenue or any other durable value-capture model. Hibernation therefore cannot be blamed on a token launch, and the absence of a token does not establish that the underlying business had adequate revenue.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:token_and_value_capture:1","claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:token_and_value_capture:2"]},"counterfactual":{"body":"A custodial sportsbook could have hidden wallet and cross-chain complexity and guaranteed selected odds, but would add custody, withdrawals, licensing and balance-sheet exposure. Focusing on one source of liquidity might reduce integration failures while worsening price and market coverage. A token-incentive program could subsidize early order books, but would risk attracting temporary activity and does not solve product-market fit. A distribution partner with an existing bettor audience might have addressed the narrow crypto-native funnel. These are plausible alternatives, not proven explanations; no source shows which would have prevented hibernation.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:counterfactual:1","claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:counterfactual:2"]},"risks_and_unknowns":{"body":"The current risk is inactivity: a reachable document or program address does not mean bettors can place and settle new bets. Historical users depended on Purebet’s matching engine, router, external protocols, market data and frontend as well as Solana. Legal operator, licence, jurisdiction restrictions, program addresses and governance were not verified. No current customer-liability, volume, liquidity, active-user or security data exists in the reviewed record. The hibernation start date, cause, remaining onchain activity, community support and relaunch funding are also unknown.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:risks_and_unknowns:1","claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:risks_and_unknowns:2"]},"lifecycle":{"body":"Purebet published its exchange model on December 15, 2022 and marked completion of its first product phase with a promotion on April 7, 2023. That promotion required wallet and transaction-hash proof from users of other onchain betting protocols, confirming an operating customer flow. By the 2026-08-03 review, the official frontend said the product was hibernating. No source supplies the hibernation start date or a permanent closure statement. The correct lifecycle label is failed/paused for the official customer product, with legacy code and remaining onchain activity explicitly unresolved.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:lifecycle:1","claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:lifecycle:2"]},"outlook_and_watch":{"body":"The base case is continued hibernation because no dated relaunch, new markets or current development release was found. An upside case requires a verified frontend reopening, new program release, active market list and settled bets with visible liquidity. A downside case is permanent abandonment or disappearance of remaining support. Watch the official homepage and community announcements, repository or program releases, market creation, liquidity-wallet flows, settled bets, relaunch funding, legal-entity disclosures and user support. Do not upgrade the lifecycle from a Discord message, a stale directory listing or one unexplained program transaction.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:outlook_and_watch:1","claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:outlook_and_watch:2"]}}},"metrics":[],"events":[{"id":"event:purebet-solana-exchange:product-description","type":"launch_evidence","date":"2022-12-15","description":"Purebet published its operating exchange and aggregation model.","claim_ids":["claim:purebet-solana-exchange:event:product-description"],"date_precision":"day"},{"id":"event:purebet-solana-exchange:phase-one","type":"product_milestone","date":"2023-04-07","description":"Purebet published a promotion marking completion of its first product phase.","claim_ids":["claim:purebet-solana-exchange:event:phase-one"],"date_precision":"day"},{"id":"event:purebet-solana-exchange:hibernating-observation","type":"pause","date":"2026-08-03","description":"The official homepage identified Purebet as hibernating; the start date remains unknown.","claim_ids":["claim:purebet-solana-exchange:event:hibernating-observation"],"date_precision":"day"}],"sources":[{"id":"source:purebet-solana-exchange:home","title":"Purebet — Decentralized Sports Betting on Solana","url":"https://purebet.io/","publisher":"Purebet","published_at":null,"accessed_at":"2026-08-03T19:31:32Z","archive_url":null,"tier":"B","role":"primary","access_state":"reachable","checked_at":"2026-08-03T19:31:32Z","content_hash":null,"evidence_locator":"Current official homepage states that Purebet is hibernating.","resolving":true},{"id":"source:purebet-solana-exchange:how","title":"How Purebet works","url":"https://purebet.medium.com/how-purebet-works-61fc02d1dda9","publisher":"Purebet","published_at":"2022-12-15","accessed_at":"2026-08-03T19:31:32Z","archive_url":null,"tier":"B","role":"primary","access_state":"reachable","checked_at":"2026-08-03T19:31:32Z","content_hash":null,"evidence_locator":"Official article explains the exchange, cross-protocol routing, wallet settlement and USDC use.","resolving":true},{"id":"source:purebet-solana-exchange:promotion","title":"Phase 1 Completion Celebration Promotion","url":"https://docs.purebet.io/promotion-terms/phase-1-completion-celebration-promotion-07-04-23","publisher":"Purebet","published_at":"2023-04-07","accessed_at":"2026-08-03T19:31:32Z","archive_url":null,"tier":"B","role":"primary","access_state":"reachable","checked_at":"2026-08-03T19:31:32Z","content_hash":null,"evidence_locator":"Historical promotion documents Solana wallet proofs and cross-protocol user acquisition.","resolving":true},{"id":"source:purebet-solana-exchange:docs","title":"Purebet API and SDK","url":"https://docs.purebet.io/","publisher":"Purebet","published_at":null,"accessed_at":"2026-08-03T19:31:32Z","archive_url":null,"tier":"B","role":"primary","access_state":"reachable","checked_at":"2026-08-03T19:31:32Z","content_hash":null,"evidence_locator":"Legacy developer endpoint remains reachable; reachability does not prove active maintenance.","resolving":true},{"id":"source:purebet-solana-exchange:medium","title":"Purebet publication archive","url":"https://purebet.medium.com/","publisher":"Purebet","published_at":null,"accessed_at":"2026-08-03T19:31:32Z","archive_url":null,"tier":"B","role":"primary","access_state":"reachable","checked_at":"2026-08-03T19:31:32Z","content_hash":null,"evidence_locator":"Official publication archive provides historical product material, not current operation.","resolving":true},{"id":"source:purebet-solana-exchange:dappradar","title":"Purebet project directory","url":"https://dappradar.com/dapp/purebet","publisher":"DappRadar","published_at":null,"accessed_at":"2026-08-03T19:31:32Z","archive_url":null,"tier":"B","role":"independent","access_state":"reachable","checked_at":"2026-08-03T19:31:32Z","content_hash":null,"evidence_locator":"Independent directory retains the historical Solana product description and no-token claim; it does not establish current activity.","resolving":true}],"claims":[{"id":"claim:purebet-solana-exchange:status","field_path":"status.operating_state","assertion":"Purebet was hibernating at the review date.","value":"hibernating","as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:purebet-solana-exchange:home"],"evidence_locator":"The current official homepage explicitly says Purebet is hibernating.","support_direction":"supports","note":null,"review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:purebet-solana-exchange:outcome","field_path":"outcome.label","assertion":"Purebet is classified failed paused as of 2026-08-03.","value":"failed_paused","as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"inference","source_ids":["source:purebet-solana-exchange:home","source:purebet-solana-exchange:how","source:purebet-solana-exchange:promotion"],"evidence_locator":"A once-operating product now presents a hibernation notice; no permanent shutdown or cause is inferred.","support_direction":"supports","note":"Lifecycle classification, not a claim of profitability, solvency, legality in every market, or one exclusive cause.","review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:what_it_is:1","field_path":"analysis.sections.what_it_is.body","assertion":"Purebet historically combined its own Solana orderbook with cross-protocol liquidity routing.","value":"Purebet historically combined its own Solana orderbook with cross-protocol liquidity routing.","as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:purebet-solana-exchange:how","source:purebet-solana-exchange:promotion"],"evidence_locator":"Official historical product and promotion material.","support_direction":"supports","note":null,"review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:what_it_is:2","field_path":"analysis.sections.what_it_is.body","assertion":"The model used wallet-based USDC betting and automatic settlement rather than a conventional custodial account.","value":"The model used wallet-based USDC betting and automatic settlement rather than a conventional custodial account.","as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:purebet-solana-exchange:how"],"evidence_locator":"Official historical operating description.","support_direction":"supports","note":null,"review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:what_happened:1","field_path":"analysis.sections.what_happened.body","assertion":"Purebet had a functioning historical exchange and cross-protocol acquisition campaign in 2022–2023.","value":"Purebet had a functioning historical exchange and cross-protocol acquisition campaign in 2022–2023.","as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:purebet-solana-exchange:how","source:purebet-solana-exchange:promotion"],"evidence_locator":"Dated official product records.","support_direction":"supports","note":null,"review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:what_happened:2","field_path":"analysis.sections.what_happened.body","assertion":"The current official frontend is hibernating and does not establish a permanent shutdown date.","value":"The current official frontend is hibernating and does not establish a permanent shutdown date.","as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:purebet-solana-exchange:home"],"evidence_locator":"Current homepage status.","support_direction":"supports","note":null,"review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:why_this_outcome:1","field_path":"analysis.sections.why_this_outcome.body","assertion":"No reviewed source identifies the binding cause of hibernation.","value":"No reviewed source identifies the binding cause of hibernation.","as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"unknown","source_ids":["source:purebet-solana-exchange:home","source:purebet-solana-exchange:how","source:purebet-solana-exchange:promotion"],"evidence_locator":"Current status and historical model without a causal closure statement.","support_direction":"supports","note":null,"review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:why_this_outcome:2","field_path":"analysis.sections.why_this_outcome.body","assertion":"The model depended on its own orderbook, external protocols and crypto-native user acquisition.","value":"The model depended on its own orderbook, external protocols and crypto-native user acquisition.","as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"medium","kind":"inference","source_ids":["source:purebet-solana-exchange:how","source:purebet-solana-exchange:promotion"],"evidence_locator":"Historical routing and promotion design.","support_direction":"supports","note":null,"review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:strategic_choices:1","field_path":"analysis.sections.strategic_choices.body","assertion":"Purebet chose noncustodial exchange routing through a single Solana user experience.","value":"Purebet chose noncustodial exchange routing through a single Solana user experience.","as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:purebet-solana-exchange:how"],"evidence_locator":"Historical operating model.","support_direction":"supports","note":null,"review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:strategic_choices:2","field_path":"analysis.sections.strategic_choices.body","assertion":"The 2023 campaign targeted existing onchain betting users and no native token was identified.","value":"The 2023 campaign targeted existing onchain betting users and no native token was identified.","as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:purebet-solana-exchange:promotion","source:purebet-solana-exchange:dappradar"],"evidence_locator":"Historical campaign and independent directory record.","support_direction":"supports","note":null,"review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:operating_model:1","field_path":"analysis.sections.operating_model.body","assertion":"The exchange matched own orders or routed to an integrated venue and returned settlement to wallets.","value":"The exchange matched own orders or routed to an integrated venue and returned settlement to wallets.","as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:purebet-solana-exchange:how"],"evidence_locator":"Historical step-by-step product flow.","support_direction":"supports","note":null,"review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:purebet-solana-exchange:section:operating_model:2","field_path":"analysis.sections.operating_model.body","assertion":"Routing could fail and leave an order unmatched, preserving frontend and integration dependency.","value":"Routing could fail and leave an order unmatched, preserving frontend and integration dependency.","as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:purebet-solana-exchange:how"],"evidence_locator":"Historical error-path disclosure.","support_direction":"suppo